Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.40,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep\Nwithin your dreams Taking aim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for your heart so it would\Nseem Stand tall and read,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,go to hell and jump for\Nparadise Every time dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,dangerous We like it serious, serious,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.28,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,oh Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.92,0:00:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The balls filled between us, they\Nwill show Still what we don't know Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.74,0:01:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,working hard together Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.30,0:01:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,it through believing in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.44,0:01:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears\Nin the world we're in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing\Nup our thought again,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.72,0:01:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah We're the foolish ones\Nwe love, we'll carry on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.74,0:01:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Till we see the light, the sun will rise
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core is\Nagainst myself forevermore Come on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,let's do it now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go The bonds built between us,\Nthey will show So what we don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.86,0:01:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,that's what we call adventure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.22,0:01:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Got to dream\Ndespite the rivalry Gotta see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,it through believing in you\NThere's even charm in failure Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.02,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,we've got superpowers Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.42,0:02:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we've got superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers Yes, we're the superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the superpowers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.26,0:02:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay with this, Chiffon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thank you, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.80,0:02:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They definitely took one hell\Nof a challenge, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Bumping her off might\Nhave to take a back seat
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.50,0:02:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,while we figure out how\Nwe're gonna blow this joint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.66,0:02:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that, Veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.72,0:03:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We agreed to help Nami and her friends\Nescape, and that's what we'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.54,0:03:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late to wimp out now\Njust to save our own hides!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.36,0:03:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how you properly pay back a debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.48,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe in the cake's flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackleg did an extraordinary job on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.40,0:03:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Chiffon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I love about you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.38,0:03:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see my cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.46,0:03:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's ditch these rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.04,0:04:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good-for-nothing pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.74,0:04:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another ship gaining on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Sweet General Smoothie's ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom may have left, but this\Nis still quite troublesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the weird squeezing lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.88,0:04:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoothie, you're here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.20,0:04:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will it take\Nto get to Kaku Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.22,0:04:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still about three hours out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.40,0:04:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be arriving there at\N1am, exactly as we promised!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.12,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we have one major problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know when or where\NLuffy is going to pop up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and we can't warn him of\Nthe danger ahead of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.94,0:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe I have a plan that could work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It should get us through this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.90,0:05:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oven, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.92,0:05:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There are more and more\Nships surrounding the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.22,0:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we sure this is necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.72,0:05:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really see General Katakuri\Nletting Straw Hat walk away, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.82,0:05:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing what Montour told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.82,0:05:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We need every unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.14,0:05:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just trust me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear this crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.88,0:05:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out that big explosion on the\NShit was a setup from the Straw Hats, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They may not look like\Nmuch, but at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,it would be a mistake if\Nwe underestimated them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.18,0:05:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If we let them escape,\Nwe'll never live it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.30,0:05:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We will ensure their journey ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In approximately three hours at 1 a .m.,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,the stragglers of the Straw\NHat crew plan to meet up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They will try to reunite\Nwith their captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.84,0:05:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of this as the last\Nchance to have our revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To not hold back. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.06,0:06:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If by some chance Straw\NHat does manage to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he's going to emerge from a mirror\Nlocated somewhere on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.18,0:06:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So I need you to go into your homes\Nand break every single mirror in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't question my orders, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But sir, some of them\Nare family heirlooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.76,0:06:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't take him too lightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish to spare a few,\Nsink them in the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.58,0:06:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We can salvage them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My point is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be the only unbroken\Nmirror on this entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.18,0:06:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And absolutely no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I find out that anyone here allowed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat to escape from their own mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,your whole family will be executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.24,0:06:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.06,0:06:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yasuie, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.14,0:06:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you,\NStraw Hat. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to when you\Nlearn that this is no ordinary exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.70,0:07:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your entrance to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, I failed to\Nnotice her needles at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite foolish of me. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,About fairness, this is\Na fight between pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault for not\Nbeing able to dodge them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For the record,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.28,0:08:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer think that you're\Ninferior to me really all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.18,0:08:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dodge me 100 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Failing this routine will\Nmean no dinner for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds awful, right? Then focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking your opponent would\Nattack from the front is naive.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find reading an\Nanimal's mind is easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,as they show their emotions on their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,However, interpreting a\Nhuman is vastly different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We can deceive others\Nand defy expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.32,0:08:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,F-f-fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a fool if you\Nthink an enemy would stop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,attacking just because\Nyou need a lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's intent behind\Nevery attack by him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I smell something delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pay that any mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just my dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.24,0:09:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.20,0:09:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't go attacking\Nyour foe blindly, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt, Rayleigh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.20,0:10:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.36,0:10:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a part of Haki too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharpen your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.08,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You must feel your enemy's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.60,0:10:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I feel your anger!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.00,0:10:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.52,0:10:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.74,0:10:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.36,0:10:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take food from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.36,0:10:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Fraley says I don't\Nget to eat, and no dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lucy. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.86,0:11:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your observation hockey's a bit peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.76,0:11:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears to be attuned to the emotions\Nof not only people, but animals, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's unconscious, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that bad? Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.00,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite a useful skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.82,0:11:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Having that ability means you can sense\Nthe next actions your opponent will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to practice this talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.18,0:11:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who master it can even\Nglimpse into the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do if you\Ncome across someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.06,0:11:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you can take them on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just two years of training\Nwon't cut it, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.76,0:11:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll kind of depend on what they're like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.19,0:11:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Their personality?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.26,0:11:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never thought of it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.74,0:11:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite the odd fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.64,0:11:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it might come down to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.90,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to have some\Ntough times, without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,With that in mind, we can't\Nafford to rest for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.14,0:12:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get the next lesson underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.64,0:12:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you everything\NI can before your stay is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.48,0:12:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.52,0:13:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Burning mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.36,0:14:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If she catches up, we're toast a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.76,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget who has the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't dare touch us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.00,0:15:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, at that size, Prometheus\Nain't quite as nimble no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.28,0:15:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll reach La Karoo Island, so\Ndon't you sweat at one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.40,0:15:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the quick patch-up job on\Nour paddles, we're back to hauling ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.34,0:15:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You done excellent work, fellas. Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.08,0:15:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awfully kind!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.72,0:15:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll launch Land the cake onto the\Nisland and make a break for it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.78,0:15:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold up, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.92,0:15:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,LaCour Island is too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.28,0:15:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we should lure her\Nto Fluffy Island instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of harebrained idea is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.10,0:15:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, Mama's having hunger pangs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.54,0:15:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what do you think will happen\Nafter she has a fill of cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's going to come to her senses as what?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.82,0:15:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to give Nami more distance\Nor she'll go right for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.40,0:15:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta put ourselves first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna belly up\Nif we get sloppy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.60,0:15:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.51,0:15:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama's a monster, even more than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.84,0:16:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dying to get a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.66,0:16:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be together at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.64,0:16:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you get what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.61,0:16:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're still going to Fluffy Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I must pay back my debt to the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.04,0:16:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it will cost me my own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go by myself if I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.22,0:16:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,There's been a change of plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.02,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To Fluffy Island on a double!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason you're my gal, Siobhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You always outdoes yourself, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let's get a move on it, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you say so far, we'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.88,0:17:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, okay, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.48,0:17:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Will do You better not inch\Nany closer, you hear me, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep sharp and don't drop your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the Sonny, okay? Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Pudding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.05,0:17:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.28,0:17:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare pull\Nthat crap on me, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you lure me around\Nlike some kind of bossy husband?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sonny!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.35,0:17:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.70,0:17:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.26,0:17:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to sleep for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, you made your Cho-Bro proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.26,0:18:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,During a full moon, do Cat Viper and\NDogstorm do that cool transformation too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.52,0:18:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,All Minks can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you thought I was impressive,\Nwait till you see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They're way stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.86,0:18:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.02,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Touch the enemy and let me know which\Ndirection they're attacking from!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.60,0:18:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On it! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.42,0:18:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I need more liquid than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.82,0:18:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're going a little far?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.92,0:18:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That man is one of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more room for failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.82,0:18:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.20,0:18:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a giant woman to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.08,0:19:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see your giant panties, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.72,0:19:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off, you bony creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.94,0:19:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here comes another!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.64,0:19:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my room's covered!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Deepay, no hard support!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.62,0:19:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay on your toes, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.40,0:19:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Our survival depends on your directions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.98,0:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount and clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got your back for sure, Deepay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.06,0:19:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's going even larger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.90,0:19:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.18,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, you're gonna sink our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.68,0:19:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant to go! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.50,0:20:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.12,0:20:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Page, dodge the starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.30,0:20:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on for your dear lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Such annoying little tests!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.68,0:20:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.59,0:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate all the help you've given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that crap out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.88,0:20:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.14,0:20:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave that corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.48,0:20:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear, I don't want to be mistaken\Nas your wife. No one's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, anyway, you don't think\Nthis will actually work, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish Luffy didn't have quite so\Nmany enemies waiting on Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm gonna work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.82,0:21:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How's the operation going?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.64,0:21:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As ordered, you won't find a\Nsingle mirror on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll also be happy to know that your\Nsiblings are starting to arrive, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.82,0:21:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, sir? Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.32,0:21:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is making me kind of uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen so many\Nfamily members here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really think this is necessary\Nto capture that straw-eyed guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How many foes are headed our way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.04,0:21:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Around ten, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.88,0:21:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.52,0:21:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.43,0:21:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake me up if something happens. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst generation, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make an example of these guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe then the others\Nwill get the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My pride as a former\Ngeneral is on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.12,0:22:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Summoning all these forces\Nto fight a handful will pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,A shameful day for the Big Mom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.20,0:22:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are they truly a force of nature?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Only time will tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How sure are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.56,0:22:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This seems a bit excessive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.32,0:22:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like a festival—let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.24,0:22:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.74,0:22:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,shut your traps!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.98,0:22:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lend us a hand; we need everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.64,0:22:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that Straw Hat humiliating us at the\Ntea party—we'll take his head as revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.50,0:22:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The first time we were sent after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.68,0:22:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,we should have made sure\Nhe was dealt with properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.96,0:22:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he and his friends\Nhave made a mockery of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.54,0:22:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,a break—this is so annoying now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.04,0:22:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That we can't track them\Nwith our territory slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's an
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,awful lot of us here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This should be a cinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.22,0:22:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll find out soon, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got about an hour left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no room for error.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all finished\Nthis time approximately.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.10,0:23:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,this time approximately Only\None hour remains until the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats are supposed to\Nreconvene on Kaku Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.38,0:23:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Straw Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.06,0:23:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you've got? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.94,0:23:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.40,0:23:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.60,0:23:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I accept the challenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.26,0:23:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wrapping this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.00,0:23:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how this one will go. Let's.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I welcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourth gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.30,0:24:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.72,0:25:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Snake-man, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.34,0:25:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And how's that different\Nthan the last one?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.92,0:25:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike Bounce-man, this\Nform is designed for speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.64,0:25:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Haki can't keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.38,0:25:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one punch after all that bragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.06,0:25:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.40,0:25:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it coming from the side?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.84,0:25:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I see the punch clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.70,0:26:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then something strange happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.50,0:26:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,First I dodge and then I
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.14,0:26:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,see so that's how it works
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.68,0:27:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is far from over!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.68,0:27:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still stronger and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.26,0:27:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your tricks are nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.46,0:27:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hacksaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.58,0:27:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've caught Mochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, it's too sticky!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.52,0:28:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting dizzy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.14,0:28:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.40,0:28:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.14,0:28:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.56,0:28:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.68,0:28:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get this stuff off!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Straw Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.62,0:28:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.78,0:29:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.18,0:29:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.64,0:29:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.16,0:29:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.84,0:29:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.84,0:29:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that all you wanted to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.56,0:29:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and I feel a lot better now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.02,0:29:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.76,0:29:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.22,0:30:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm going to jet cover it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.84,0:30:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.86,0:30:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.28,0:30:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.46,0:30:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Uuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.64,0:30:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.92,0:30:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.12,0:30:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Python!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.52,0:30:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh! Wuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.80,0:30:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Right there !εν!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.71,0:30:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd they?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.63,0:30:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.54,0:30:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.27,0:30:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aaaahhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.76,0:31:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.10,0:31:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.04,0:31:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.26,0:31:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.04,0:31:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no charging this!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.82,0:31:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come! Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.18,0:31:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,SCREAMING
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.08,0:32:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After this attack, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.78,0:32:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me you're ready to quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.66,0:32:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.68,0:32:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That move, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.32,0:32:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.94,0:32:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.22,0:33:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep thinking of Monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.74,0:33:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope he's alright out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.08,0:33:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't heard any news.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.04,0:33:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep rising higher, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.66,0:33:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.82,0:33:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,First time, Moji!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.94,0:33:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,King Pobra! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.10,0:33:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape now!
